<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-4</name><desc>H-4 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It runs 5.4 km from the MTB-3 junction to the T-1 junction, climbing about 46 m and descending 107 m in the direction drawn, between 1,419 m and 1,498 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-4/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
